mers learn about their  problems invest your time and energy  into making them super happy and solving  their needs and then if you decide later  on that a product based business is for  you you have some cash flow coming in  you know you can support yourself and  you know the specific problems of your  customers and you can sell a product to  them but certain our product business  from the start can be really time  intensive  but all intensive and a lot harder to to  make a success so I hope that helps if  you liked the video please leave a  comment below I'd love to hear what your  thoughts are and if you did like it  please leave a thumbs up to i always get  happy when I see thumbs up on my videos  so i hope i'll hear from you soon and  stay tuned for next episode  you
 

